Homepage: https://github.com/FreeMixer/libsurface
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: libsurface0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: device behaviour of motorised control surfaces
 libsurface is the device behaviour of a motorised control surface, written
 once for every surface and every host: a motor-fader policy that never fights
 the hand, touch with a self-heal and a release debounce, the bank window, a
 shadow of the whole board replayed when a device comes back blank, meter steps
 with hysteresis, LED ring rendering, and the health lists of faders that cannot
 be trusted. It speaks no wire and knows no mixing semantics.

Package: libsurface-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libsurface0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: device behaviour of motorised control surfaces, development files
 The header and the pkg-config file libsurface, for building a control-surface
 host or backend on libsurface.
